PROJECT: Ethereum

## Core Insights

Insight 1: Distribusi token paling merata di antara Layer 1 besar karena single public sale tanpa VC unlock overhang
Explanation: Ethereum hanya melakukan satu crowdsale publik 42 hari (2014-07-22 s.d. 2014-09-02) menjual 60M ETH ke >9.000 peserta, 12M ETH ke Foundation/early contributors, tanpa private sale, tanpa vesting investor, tanpa token allocation untuk VC【Phase 3 — EV-005】【Phase 3 — EV-006】【Phase 5 — Token Sale】【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Evidence: Crowdsale raising 31.529 BTC (~$18.3M); 100% unlocked at genesis; no traditional investor allocation【Phase 5 — Funding History】【Phase 6 — TGE】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-005, EV-006; Phase 5 Funding History, Token Sale; Phase 6 Distribution, TGE
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 2: Arsitektur modular execution/consensus separation via Engine API memungkinkan multi-client diversity production-proven
Explanation: Beacon Chain (consensus) dan execution layer (EVM) terpisah sepenuhnya, terhubung via Engine API standar (engine_forkchoiceUpdated, engine_newPayload), memungkinkan 4 execution client + 5 consensus client interoperable【Phase 4 — System Architecture】【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 3 — EV-026】
Evidence: Geth, Besu, Nethermind, Erigon (execution); Prysm, Lighthouse, Teku, Nimbus, Lodestar (consensus); Engine API specs【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 4 — System Architecture】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 System Architecture, Core Components, Core Components; Phase 3 EV-019, EV-020, EV-025, EV-026
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 3: Roadmap rollup-centric scaling (L2 execution + L1 settlement/DA) berhasil menggeser throughput ke L2 tanpa mengorbankan L1 decentralization
Explanation: Vitalik rollup-centric roadmap 2020 → Dencun upgrade 2024-03-13 mengaktifkan EIP-4844 blob space → L2 fees turun >90%, L2 transaksi harian 12-15M vs L1 1-1.3M, L2 TVL $42.8B combined【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】
Evidence: Dencun activation; L2Beat tracking 50+ L2; Arbitrum $16.2B, Optimism $6.8B, Base $8.1B TVL【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-028; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics, Narrative Position; Phase 7 Major Integrations (10 L2)
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 4: Off-chain social consensus governance (EIP process + All Core Devs + client signaling) berfungsi tanpa on-chain token voting
Explanation: Keputusan upgrade melalui rough consensus pada EIP discussions, All Core Devs calls, client team implementation choice, validator adoption signaling — tidak ada token-weighted voting【Phase 4 — Governance】【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern】
Evidence: DAO fork 2016 menunjukkan social consensus > code immutability; Merge activation butuh semua 4 execution + 5 consensus client release + validator upgrade【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 3 — EV-025】【Phase 3 — EV-026】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-012, EV-025, EV-026; Phase 4 Governance; Phase 6 Governance; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern
Confidence: HIGH

Insight 5: Protocol revenue (burn, issuance, MEV) mengalir ke validator/staker on-chain transparan, bukan ke treasury EF
Explanation: EIP-1559 base fee burn (>4.3M ETH burned), PoS issuance ke validator (~0.5-0.8%/thn), priority tips + MEV-Boost ke proposer, blob fees burn — semua on-chain, EF tidak menerima protocol revenue【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】【Phase 3 — EV-022】【Phase 3 — EV-028】
