## Strategic Principles

Principle 1: Credible neutrality sebagai prinsip governance — protokol tidak memihak aplikasi, tidak menyensor transaksi di base layer
Explanation: OFAC Tornado Cash sanctions 2022 — protokol tidak fork; ~20-30% builder censored tapi transaksi tetap masuk via non-censoring builder; PBS/MEV-Boost design memisahkan proposer dari builder【Phase 3 — EV-034】【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 3】
Evidence: No protocol-level censorship atau blacklist; compliance di layer atas (builder/relay) voluntary【Phase 3 — EV-034】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 3】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-034; Phase 4 Security Model; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 3
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 2: Modular architecture dengan pemisahan execution dan consensus layer via standardized interface (Engine API)
Explanation: Beacon Chain dirancang terpisah sejak Phase 0 spec; Engine API jadi kontrak antar klien; memungkinkan 4 execution + 5 consensus client interoperable【Phase 3 — EV-019】【Phase 3 — EV-020】【Phase 4 — System Architecture】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 1】
Evidence: Execution specs + Consensus specs terpisah di GitHub; Engine API standardized【Phase 4 — System Architecture】【Phase 4 — Core Components】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-019, EV-020, EV-025, EV-026; Phase 4 System Architecture, Core Components; Phase 9 Technical Decision Pattern Pola 1
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 3: Research-driven roadmap dengan spec-first approach — riset kriptografi/konsensus dipublikasikan spec draft → community review → EIP → client implementation
Explanation: EF research team (Justin Drake, Dankrad Feist, Danny Ryan) produksi spec → ethresear.ch, EIPs, Magicians review → client implementation → testnet → mainnet【Phase 2 — Entity: Justin Drake】【Phase 2 — Entity: Dankrad Feist】【Phase 2 — Entity: Danny Ryan】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 5】
Evidence: Danksharding spec (Dankrad); PBS spec (Flashbots+EF); Single-slot finality research (Justin Drake); semua transparan sebelum implementasi【Phase 2 — Entity: Justin Drake】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 5】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2 Entities (Drake, Feist, Ryan); Phase 3 EV-029; Phase 4 Known Limitations; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 5
Confidence: HIGH

Principle 4: Multi-client architecture untuk critical infrastructure — setiap layer kritis memiliki multiple independent implementations
Explanation: 4 execution client, 5 consensus client, 2 networking stack (devp2p, libp2p), multiple cryptography lib; EF grants ke semua tim client【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 5 — Financial Dependencies】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 1】
