Confidence: HIGH

Principle 5: Backward compatibility ketat — tidak ada breaking change tanpa migration path multi-tahun
Explanation: SELFDESTRUCT deprecation EIP-6049 (Shanghai) tapi EIP-6780 (Dencun) hanya allow same-tx; EOF activation pending bertahun-tahun; legacy bytecode support tetap【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 3 — EV-029】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 3】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 5】
Evidence: Semua upgrade additive; deprecation warnings bertahun-tahun sebelum enforcement【Phase 3 — EV-017】【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 3 — EV-028】
