Principle 7: Infrastructure provider redundancy — minimal 2 major RPC providers (Infura, Alchemy) + alternatives, EF tidak menjalankan RPC publik
Explanation: Infura (Consensys) dan Alchemy dua provider dominan; QuickNode, Chainstack, Blockdaemon, Figment, Kiln, P2P.org, Allnodes, StakeFish sebagai alternatif; Cloud providers managed nodes【Phase 2 — Entity: Infura】【Phase 2 — Entity: Alchemy】【Phase 7 — Infrastructure Providers】【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern Pola 2】
