## Success Factors

Factor 1: Single public sale tanpa VC unlock overhang menciptakan distribusi token paling merata dan menghindari tekanan jual besar terjadwal
Evidence: Crowdsale 2014: 60M ETH ke publik, 12M ETH Foundation/early contributors, 100% unlocked at genesis; tidak ada investor tradisional dengan hak preferensial【Phase 3 — EV-005】【Phase 3 — EV-006】【Phase 5 — Token Sale】【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-005, EV-006; Phase 5 Funding History, Token Sale; Phase 6 Distribution, TGE
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 2: Multi-client architecture production-proven (9+ client) memberikan resilience terhadap client bugs — tidak ada single point of failure di layer klien
Evidence: Geth, Besu, Nethermind, Erigon (execution); Prysm, Lighthouse, Teku, Nimbus, Lodestar (consensus); Client diversity dashboard tracking market share【Phase 4 — Core Components】【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】
