## Failure Factors

Factor 1: L1 throughput terbatas (~15 TPS base layer) bergantung sepenuhnya pada L2 untuk scaling — L1 tidak bisa serve mass adoption langsung
Evidence: Phase 4 Known Limitations: Throughput ~15-20 TPS simple transfers; ~100-200 TPS dengan blob data; tidak cukup global-scale tanpa L2【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics (L1 1-1.3M tx/hari vs L2 12-15M)
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 2: Finality latency 12.8 menit (2 epochs) tidak cocok untuk real-time applications tanpa L2/optimistic confirmation
Evidence: Consensus specs: slot 12 detik, finality ~12.8 menit (2 epochs); single-slot finality (Orbit SSF) research aktif tapi belum consensus【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 1】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Consensus Mechanism, Known Technical Limitations; Phase 9 Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 1
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 3: State growth unbounded (~200GB+ archive) — history expiry (EIP-4444) dan statelessness (Verkle trees) research mature tapi belum delivery
Evidence: EIP-4444 spec draft; Verkle trees research (Vitalik, Dankrad); client implementation belum mulai production; "The Verge" roadmap tanpa timeline konkrit【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Open Threads】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 9 Open Threads
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 4: Client diversity risk — Geth ~50% execution client, Prysm/Lighthouse/Teku consensus concentration; tidak ada mekanisme protokol enforce diversity
Evidence: Client diversity dashboard; target tidak ada client >1/3 market share; social coordination saja【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 3】【Phase 8 — Open Threads】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Security Model, Known Technical Limitations; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics; Phase 9 Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 3
Confidence: HIGH

Factor 5: Validator centralization via LST — Lido stETH >25% staked ETH menciptakan operator concentration (~30 Node Operators); DVT adoption lambat; protokol tidak punya enforcement mechanism
Evidence: Lido stETH ~28% staked ETH; Rated Network operator metrics; solo staking barrier 32 ETH + hardware + uptime【Phase 7 — Lido Integration】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 4】
