Confidence: HIGH

Factor 6: MEV/builder censorship ~20-30% blocks (OFAC compliance), inclusion lists (EIP-7547) belum live
Evidence: mevboost.pics builder market share; Flashbots MEV-Boost >90% blocks; EIP-7547 spec draft; censorship resistance work in progress【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 7 — Flashbots Integration】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 3】
