## Decision Framework

Step 1: Research & Specification — EF research team (Justin Drake, Dankrad Feist, Danny Ryan) memproduksi spec draft (Danksharding, PBS, Verkle trees, Quantum resistance) dipublikasikan transparan di ethresear.ch, GitHub, EIPs
Evidence: EF research repo; ethresear.ch forum; Danksharding spec; PBS spec; Single-slot finality research【Phase 2 — Entity: Justin Drake】【Phase 2 — Entity: Dankrad Feist】【Phase 2 — Entity: Danny Ryan】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 5】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2 Entities (Drake, Feist, Ryan); Phase 3 EV-029; Phase 4 Known Limitations; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 5
Confidence: HIGH

Step 2: Community Review & EIP Process — Spec draft → community review via ethresear.ch, Ethereum Magicians, EIP editors → EIP formalization (draft → review → last call → final) → client team review
Evidence: EIP-1 process; EIPs repository; Ethereum Magicians forum; All Core Devs calls tracking【Phase 4 — Governance】【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 1】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Governance; Phase 6 Governance; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 1
Confidence: HIGH

Step 3: Client Implementation & Testing — Client teams (Geth, Besu, Nethermind, Erigon, Prysm, Lighthouse, Teku, Nimbus, Lodestar) implement EIP → devnet testing → public testnet (Sepolia/Holesky) → shadow fork (mainnet state) → Kurtosis multi-container integration testing
Evidence: Merge: Kiln testnet → shadow forks → Bellatrix → Paris; Dencun: devnet → Sepolia → Holesky → mainnet; Pectra: devnet-0,1,2【Phase 3 — EV-024】【Phase 3 — EV-025】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 3 — EV-029】【Phase 4 — Dev Tools】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 2】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-024, EV-025, EV-026, EV-028, EV-029; Phase 4 Dev Tools, Technical Upgrade History; Phase 9 Technical Decision Pattern Pola 2
Confidence: HIGH

Step 4: Multi-Stakeholder Coordination — Tim Beiko (Protocol Support Lead) fasilitasi timeline client teams; All Core Devs calls tracking client readiness; validator signaling via client version upgrade; app developer compatibility testing
Evidence: Merge activation butuh 4 execution + 5 consensus client release + validator upgrade; Shanghai butuh client support EIP-4895; Dencun butuh blob support semua client【Phase 2 — Entity: Tim Beiko】【Phase 3 — EV-025】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 4】
