Confidence: HIGH

Step 5: Activation & Monitoring — Upgrade activation via block number (execution) atau epoch (consensus) setelah supermajority client ready; post-upgrade monitoring via client diversity dashboard, beaconcha.in, ultrasound.money
Evidence: Bellatrix epoch 144.896 → Paris TTD 58750000000000000000000; Shanghai blok 17.034.870 / epoch 194.048; Dencun blok 19.426.587 / epoch 269.568【Phase 3 — EV-025】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 3】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-025, EV-026, EV-027, EV-028; Phase 9 Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 3
Confidence: HIGH

Step 6: Emergency Response (jika perlu) — Critical bug/exploit → client teams patch dalam hari → emergency hard fork jika consensus layer affected (2016: Tangerine Whistle + Spurious Dragon dalam 1 bulan)
