## Reusable Playbook

Playbook 1: Fair launch via single public sale tanpa VC — distribusi merata, no unlock overhang, community-owned dari hari pertama
Evidence: Crowdsale 2014: 42 hari, 31.529 BTC, 60M ETH publik, 12M ETH Foundation/early contributors, 100% unlocked genesis【Phase 3 — EV-005】【Phase 3 — EV-006】【Phase 5 — Token Sale】【Phase 6 — Distribution】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-005, EV-006; Phase 5 Funding History, Token Sale; Phase 6 Distribution, TGE
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 2: Modular architecture dengan standardized interface (Engine API) memungkinkan multi-client diversity dan independent development
Evidence: Execution/consensus split; Engine API kontrakt antar klien; 4 execution + 5 consensus client production; client diversity dashboard【Phase 3 — EV-019】【Phase 3 — EV-020】【Phase 4 — System Architecture】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 1】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-019, EV-020, EV-025, EV-026; Phase 4 System Architecture, Core Components; Phase 9 Technical Decision Pattern Pola 1
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 3: Rollup-centric scaling — L1 sebagai settlement/DA layer, L2 sebagai execution layer; blob space (EIP-4844) dirancang untuk L2 data availability
Evidence: Dencun upgrade blob gas market; L2 TVL $42.8B; L2 transaksi 12-15M/hari; 50+ L2 tracked by L2Beat【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 7 — Major Integrations】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】【Phase 9 — Ecosystem Decision Pattern Pola 1】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-028; Phase 7 Major Integrations; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics, Narrative Position; Phase 9 Ecosystem Decision Pattern Pola 1
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 4: Grant-based ecosystem funding — EF ESP >$100M kumulatif untuk research, dev tools, community, infrastructure; Protocol Guild weight-based allocation dari donor ekosistem
Evidence: ESP rolling applications; Academic Grants kriptografi/formal verification; Next Billion Fellowship Global South; Protocol Guild donor: Lido, Uniswap, Optimism, Arbitrum, Base【Phase 5 — Funding History】【Phase 7 — Grant Programs】【Phase 9 — Financial Decision Pattern Pola 2】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5 Funding History, Grants; Phase 7 Grant Programs; Phase 9 Financial Decision Pattern Pola 2
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 5: Transparent on-chain economics — burn, issuance, MEV revenue visible real-time (ultrasound.money, beaconcha.in, mevboost.pics); protocol revenue ke validator/staker bukan treasury
Evidence: EIP-1559 base fee burn >4.3M ETH; PoS issuance ke validator; priority tips + MEV-Boost ke proposer; blob fees burn【Phase 5 — Revenue Model】【Phase 6 — Inflation/Deflation】【Phase 7 — Flashbots Integration】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5 Revenue Model; Phase 6 Inflation/Deflation; Phase 7 Flashbots Integration
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 6: Staged upgrade process dengan testnet ekstensif — devnet → public testnet → shadow fork → mainnet; Kurtosis multi-container integration testing; client readiness tracking
Evidence: Merge: Kiln → shadow forks → Bellatrix → Paris; Dencun: devnet → Sepolia → Holesky → mainnet; Pectra: devnet-0,1,2【Phase 3 — EV-024】【Phase 3 — EV-025】【Phase 3 — EV-026】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 3 — EV-029】【Phase 4 — Dev Tools】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 2】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-024, EV-025, EV-026, EV-028, EV-029; Phase 4 Dev Tools, Technical Upgrade History; Phase 9 Technical Decision Pattern Pola 2
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 7: Credible neutrality principle — protokol tidak sensor, tidak memihak aplikasi; compliance di layer atas (builder/relay, infrastructure provider) voluntary
Evidence: OFAC Tornado Cash sanctions — protokol tidak fork; ~20-30% builder censored tapi transaksi masuk via non-censoring builder; PBS design memisahkan proposer dari builder【Phase 3 — EV-034】【Phase 4 — Security Model】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 3】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-034; Phase 4 Security Model; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 3
Confidence: HIGH

Playbook 8: Cryptographic trusted setup ceremony terbuka — KZG ceremony 2023 >140k partisipan MPC dengan entropy browser; transcript publik; verification on-chain; no single party reconstruct toxic waste
Evidence: KZG Ceremony 2023 untuk EIP-4844; ceremony.ethereum.org; multi-party computation; hasil diverifikasi on-chain【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 2】
