Playbook 9: Backward compatibility ketat via additive upgrades — tidak breaking change tanpa migration path multi-tahun; deprecation warnings bertahun-tahun; legacy support tetap
Evidence: SELFDESTRUCT deprecation EIP-6049 (Shanghai) → EIP-6780 (Dencun) same-tx only; EOF pending Pectra tapi legacy bytecode tetap didukung; CREATE2 additive【Phase 3 — EV-017】【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 3 — EV-028】【Phase 3 — EV-029】【Phase 9 — Technical Decision Pattern Pola 3】【Phase 9 — Recurring Behavioral Pattern Pola 5】
