Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-012, EV-013, EV-014; Phase 9 Risk Response Pattern Pola 1, Pola 2
Confidence: HIGH

## Anti-patterns

Anti-pattern 1: Over-centralization di infrastructure layer — bergantung single RPC provider (Infura/Alchemy) menciptakan single point of failure meskipun protokol terdesentralisasi
Evidence: Infura dan Alchemy dua provider dominan; >90% traffic dApp melewati Infura pada puncak; EF tidak menjalankan RPC publik; komunitas mendorong RPC diversity【Phase 2 — Entity: Infura】【Phase 2 — Entity: Alchemy】【Phase 7 — Infrastructure Providers】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 2 Entities (Infura, Alchemy); Phase 7 Infrastructure Providers; Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 2: Premature scaling via L1 gas limit increase — naikkan gas limit L1 signifikan akan mengekslusikan full node commodity hardware, mengorbankan desentralisasi
Evidence: Phase 4 Known Limitations: Gas limit ~30M target; state growth ~200GB+ archive; history expiry (EIP-4444) belum live; scaling via L2 blob data bukan L1 gas limit【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 2】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 9 Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 2
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 3: Poor treasury management — EF treasury transparency rendah (no real-time dashboard, Swiss annual report hanya ringkas ~$1.6M), holding on-chain tidak diungkap, community meminta lebih transparan
Evidence: Ethereum Foundation Annual Report 2023; Swiss Foundation Registry; tidak ada dashboard treasury real-time publik resmi【Phase 5 — Treasury】【Phase 9 — Open Threads】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 5 Treasury; Phase 9 Open Threads
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 4: Governance capture risk — informal social consensus slow untuk kontroversi besar, no binding mechanism; bergantung client team signaling yang bisa terpusat
Evidence: DAO fork 2016 preseden; tidak ada on-chain token voting; EIP process + All Core Devs calls; client teams men Signaling support via version upgrade【Phase 3 — EV-012】【Phase 4 — Governance】【Phase 6 — Governance】【Phase 9 — Governance Decision Pattern Pola 1】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-012; Phase 4 Governance; Phase 6 Governance; Phase 9 Governance Decision Pattern Pola 1
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 5: Validator centralization via liquid staking tanpa protocol enforcement — Lido stETH >25% staked ETH, operator concentration ~30 Node Operators; DVT adoption lambat; protokol tidak punya mechanism enforce diversity
Evidence: Lido stETH ~28% staked ETH; Rated Network operator metrics; solo staking barrier 32 ETH; Protocol Guild funding DVT (Obol, SSV) tapi adoption lambat【Phase 7 — Lido Integration】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 4】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-027; Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 7 Lido Integration; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics; Phase 9 Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 4
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 6: MEV extraction merugikan user tanpa mitigation awal — front-running, sandwich attacks; Flashbots formed 2020 (5 tahun post-launch) untuk transparansi; PBS in-protocol masih roadmap
Evidence: Flashbots formed 2020 (EV-033); MEV-Boost >90% blocks; PBS roadmap; inclusion lists (EIP-7547) proposal; OFAC censorship ~20-30% blocks【Phase 3 — EV-033】【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 7 — Flashbots Integration】【Phase 9 — Risk Response Pattern Pola 4】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-033; Phase 4 Security Model; Phase 7 Flashbots Integration; Phase 9 Risk Response Pattern Pola 4
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 7: Delayed withdrawal mechanism — staked ETH illiquid 2.5 tahun (Beacon Chain genesis 2020-12-01 → Shanghai withdrawals 2023-04-12); menciptakan LST dependency dan centralization pressure
Evidence: Beacon Chain genesis 2020-12-01 (EV-020); Shanghai/Capella 2023-04-12 (EV-027) enable withdrawals; >18M ETH eligible; LST maturity pasca-Shanghai【Phase 3 — EV-020】【Phase 3 — EV-027】【Phase 7 — Lido Integration】【Phase 8 — Adoption Metrics】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 3 EV-020, EV-027; Phase 7 Lido Integration; Phase 8 Adoption Metrics
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 8: History expiry dan statelessness research mature tapi implementation deferred — EIP-4444 spec draft, Verkle trees research, "The Verge" roadmap tanpa timeline; state growth unbounded
Evidence: EIP-4444 history expiry; Verkle trees research (Vitalik, Dankrad); client implementation belum mulai production; Portal Network belum production【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 7 — External Dependencies】【Phase 9 — Open Threads】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 7 External Dependencies (Portal Network); Phase 9 Open Threads
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 9: Quantum resistance migration tanpa timeline — BLS12-381 signatures (KZG, validator) vulnerable; STARK-based vs lattice-based research; tidak ada EIP konkrit untuk validator signature migration
Evidence: Ethereum.org Quantum Resistance roadmap; Vitalik quantum post 2023; research phase, tidak ada mitigation live【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Open Threads】
Supporting Dataset: Phase 4 Known Technical Limitations; Phase 9 Open Threads
Confidence: HIGH

Anti-pattern 10: Single-slot finality research vs 2-epoch finality production — accountable safety diprioritaskan tapi latency 12.8 menit tidak cocok real-time; Orbit SSF research aktif tapi trade-off bandwidth/complexity belum resolved
Evidence: Consensus specs finality gadget; Justin Drake research single-slot finality; validator set 1M+ membuat bandwidth challenge【Phase 4 — Consensus Mechanism】【Phase 4 — Known Technical Limitations】【Phase 9 — Strategic Trade-offs Trade-off 1】
